  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can frighten foes with a roar, a glare, or just simply your majesty. Creatures in a 45-foot emanation around you must make a </span>@Check[will|against:class-spell] saving throw against your spell DC or class DC. This gains the Visual or Auditory traits depending on whether you menace them with sound or by sight. Regardless of the outcome, the creature becomes immune to your Reign of Terror for 1 day.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is </span><span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is </span><span>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}</span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.jqXUNG91nCmX7jD1]{Fierce Presence} feat, your aura’s circumstance penalty also affects saving throws they make against your Reign of Terror.</span></p>"
    },
